{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/d125d1cc51bee385ea0f0b462af8d1bb.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Pandora opened the jar, the world was cursed with ancient evils: greed, sadness, violence, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>, you play as <strong>Pyrrha</strong>, daughter of Pandora, on a journey to seal these forces away once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But each evil left behind corrupted creatures. You can face them. You can tame them. And with each decision, the world, its monsters, and you - yourself - begin to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/76290928f79e03c4d82d8200965da7be.avif?t=1759767965\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/76290928f79e03c4d82d8200965da7be.avif?t=1759767965 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/ed2814e95eed74233a40286296948a4e.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creatures don\u2019t level up, but they become stronger through <i><strong>Corruption</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make in story-events shapes your morality and, your monsters reflect that. They unlock new forms, abilities, and roles according to how you play. By acting\u00a0<i>greedily</i>, <i>violently</i> and so on - you are awarded these respective <strong>corruption points,</strong>\u00a0which are used to evolve your monsters... but it all comes at a cost.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose when, how - or IF - they change.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/d4f7a78a5317d0e8d1321f79b7933e91.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is tactical and turn-based. Each creature has its own Stats, Abilities, and Techniques that are unlocked with <strong>Flames of Will</strong>, <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>'s \u201cXP\u201d, which can be acquired through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can invest <strong>Flames</strong> in all of its attributes to define which role your monsters will play. Or use them to purchase relics to boost in you fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>can</i> <strong>Sacrifice</strong> one monster in order to strenghten another mid-fight. This may come in handy in a pinch. <i><strong>However</strong></i>, every offering is irreversible - so make sure to think twice before you act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/9ee1e3e82a19fe2c0bb2bbf0ea6a2a43.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is all about your decisions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Would you hand over a potential ally to your enemies? Or would you engage the foe in combat to protect them?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions <strong>always carry over</strong>, impacting future episodes in your journey, as well as playing a crucial role in your monsters' evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique, and you can play however you want. But remember: <i><strong>every choice has a consequence</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/8f61ed167729142c01810243b184c00f.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs are  uniquely weaved</strong>. With each attempt, the <i>maps</i>, <i>encounters</i>, and <i>events</i> <i>change</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several events to explore: some are short, while others have ever-lasting consequences. And some narrative segments only appear under specific conditions, which you must figure out how to achieve based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/2411e4ccd945de4f71757c91fa3adafb.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>, mythology is everywhere: the people you meet, the monsters you tame and the story you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster is inspired by a myth, and as you play, you don't just face these creatures - You'll also encounter gods and classical figures like Hermes, the trickster messenger; Hephaestus, your blacksmith grandpa; Hestia, the goddess of sacrificial fire and many more.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own story: Craft the legend of Pyrrha, alongside all these Greek figures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/10d15f63ec71e6a90d8a2c3533496507.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG with evolution based on <strong>Corruption</strong>, <i>NOT</i> level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters with <strong>branching</strong> <strong>forms</strong>, heavily inspired by Greek mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong> that affect gameplay and the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong> that impact  the tactical combat, as well as narrative events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps and unique encounters for each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike</strong> progression with unlockables between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two teams are the same. No two stories repeat. Shape YOUR own myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now. Demo coming soon.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973310?t=1759767965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/916a88c084632941e7c049330932131332b20423/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759767965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/28f7b6029ffd2286f51ea0fcc98b5703226527ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759767965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/28f7b6029ffd2286f51ea0fcc98b5703226527ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759767965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/d125d1cc51bee385ea0f0b462af8d1bb.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Pandora opened the jar, the world was cursed with ancient evils: greed, sadness, violence, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>, you play as <strong>Pyrrha</strong>, daughter of Pandora, on a journey to seal these forces away once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But each evil left behind corrupted creatures. You can face them. You can tame them. And with each decision, the world, its monsters, and you - yourself - begin to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/76290928f79e03c4d82d8200965da7be.avif?t=1759767965\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/76290928f79e03c4d82d8200965da7be.avif?t=1759767965 width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/ed2814e95eed74233a40286296948a4e.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creatures don\u2019t level up, but they become stronger through <i><strong>Corruption</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make in story-events shapes your morality and, your monsters reflect that. They unlock new forms, abilities, and roles according to how you play. By acting\u00a0<i>greedily</i>, <i>violently</i> and so on - you are awarded these respective <strong>corruption points,</strong>\u00a0which are used to evolve your monsters... but it all comes at a cost.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose when, how - or IF - they change.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/d4f7a78a5317d0e8d1321f79b7933e91.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is tactical and turn-based. Each creature has its own Stats, Abilities, and Techniques that are unlocked with <strong>Flames of Will</strong>, <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>'s \u201cXP\u201d, which can be acquired through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/7f63e9e18259328839b8028d9d4ee861.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can invest <strong>Flames</strong> in all of its attributes to define which role your monsters will play. Or use them to purchase relics to boost in you fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/4f4c5c5eb404d745f6aa4b13780380ec.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>can</i> <strong>Sacrifice</strong> one monster in order to strenghten another mid-fight. This may come in handy in a pinch. <i><strong>However</strong></i>, every offering is irreversible - so make sure to think twice before you act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/9ee1e3e82a19fe2c0bb2bbf0ea6a2a43.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is all about your decisions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Would you hand over a potential ally to your enemies? Or would you engage the foe in combat to protect them?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions <strong>always carry over</strong>, impacting future episodes in your journey, as well as playing a crucial role in your monsters' evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique, and you can play however you want. But remember: <i><strong>every choice has a consequence</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/071111188ace3660d485ee079f10e62c.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/8f61ed167729142c01810243b184c00f.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs are  uniquely weaved</strong>. With each attempt, the <i>maps</i>, <i>encounters</i>, and <i>events</i> <i>change</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several events to explore: some are short, while others have ever-lasting consequences. And some narrative segments only appear under specific conditions, which you must figure out how to achieve based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/c96f56f4d2f8c89003531b1e63a42b8a.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/2411e4ccd945de4f71757c91fa3adafb.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Legacy of Pandora</i>, mythology is everywhere: the people you meet, the monsters you tame and the story you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster is inspired by a myth, and as you play, you don't just face these creatures - You'll also encounter gods and classical figures like Hermes, the trickster messenger; Hephaestus, your blacksmith grandpa; Hestia, the goddess of sacrificial fire and many more.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/060639baa1bee10670843d9f6904b6bd.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own story: Craft the legend of Pyrrha, alongside all these Greek figures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.poster.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.webm?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/1ede2fd8997039d577699dd1d68e403b.mp4?t=1759767965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/10d15f63ec71e6a90d8a2c3533496507.avif?t=1759767965\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG with evolution based on <strong>Corruption</strong>, <i>NOT</i> level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters with <strong>branching</strong> <strong>forms</strong>, heavily inspired by Greek mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices</strong> that affect gameplay and the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong> that impact  the tactical combat, as well as narrative events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps and unique encounters for each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike</strong> progression with unlockables between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two teams are the same. No two stories repeat. Shape YOUR own myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now. Demo coming soon.</strong> </p>","developers":["OPP Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/1d8961503a5d97f900c6d3520005f3c7857dae16/header.jpg?t=1759767965","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Legacy of Pandora \u00a9 OPP Studios. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973310/1439843763/d5e529ae86d8d0415b14d98cc33a61a1319602e4/1756142737/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758389427","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973310/1439843763/d5e529ae86d8d0415b14d98cc33a61a1319602e4/1756142737/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758389427","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973310/1439843763/d5e529ae86d8d0415b14d98cc33a61a1319602e4/1756142737/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758389427","id":257188603,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188603/movie480.mp4?t=1758389427","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188603/movie_max.mp4?t=17583